Hypothesis WM1 : wmono asegs mA m2.
Hypothesis SKM : stk asegs m2 P (P + smsz n).
Hypothesis SST : stk asegs m2 (shad P) (shad (P + smsz n)).
Hypothesis HDR : shdr m2 P (smsz n) (needed2 n) (Z.of_nat (length (sec Σ))).

